        "title": {
          "en": "Anthropic Debuts Managed Agents, Tests AI Commerce Marketplace",
          "zh": "Anthropic推出托管代理服务并测试AI商务市场"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Anthropic launched Managed Agents on Claude, providing a managed execution layer for AI agent workflows, and also conducted an experiment with an agent-on-agent commerce marketplace.",
          "zh": "Anthropic在Claude上推出了托管代理服务，提供AI代理工作流的托管执行层，并同步进行了一项代理间电子商务市场的实验。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Managed Agents on Claude separate agent logic from runtime concerns such as orchestration, sandboxing, state management, and credentials.",
            "The system supports long-running, multi-step workflows, including integration with external tools, error recovery, and session continuity through a meta-harness architecture.",
            "Anthropic experimentally created a classified marketplace where AI agents acted as both buyers and sellers, facilitating real transactions for goods and money."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Claude上的托管代理服务将代理逻辑与编排、沙盒、状态管理和凭证等运行时问题分离。",
            "该系统支持长周期、多步骤工作流，包括通过元线束架构实现外部工具集成、错误恢复和会话连续性。",
            "Anthropic实验性地创建了一个分类市场，AI代理在此市场中同时充当买家和卖家，促成了真实商品和金钱的交易。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "These developments aim to simplify the creation and deployment of complex AI agent-based applications by abstracting runtime complexities. The agent-on-agent commerce experiment illustrates a practical, albeit early, real-world application for autonomous AI agents, indicating a potential pathway for AI to engage in economic transactions.",
          "zh": "这些进展旨在通过抽象运行时复杂性，简化复杂AI代理应用的创建和部署。代理间电子商务实验展示了自主AI代理的一个实际但处于早期阶段的真实世界应用，预示着AI参与经济交易的潜在途径。"
        },
        "source": "InfoQ (AI/ML)",
        "link": "https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/04/anthropic-managed-agents/?utm_campaign=infoq_content&utm_source=infoq&utm_medium=feed&utm_term=AI%2C+ML+%26+Data+Engineering-news"
